
---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';


---

<BaseLayout

>
  <div class="routine-page">
    <h1>Weekly Routine</h1>
    <div class="rule"></div>

    <div class="day">
      <h3>Sunday: Deep Clean</h3>
      <p>Start the week off with everything fresh, because you deserve the peace of mind to start your week off right.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="day">
      <h3>Monday: Clean Bedrooms</h3>
      <p>Vacuum, change sheets, clean windows and wipe down surfaces.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="day">
      <h3>Tuesday: Laundry</h3>
      <p>Wash colours and blacks. Also clean all the bathrooms.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="day">
      <h3>Wednesday: Kitchen Reset</h3>
      <p>Clean toaster crumbs, empty leftover food from the fridge, clean the stovetop, and wash sink stoppers in the dishwasher. Clean out the compost bin and garbage and recycling bins, and add new bags. Wipe down surfaces, refill dish and hand soap containers, and refill cleaning wipes and paper towels.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="day">
      <h3>Thursday: Laundry</h3>
      <p>Wash whites, throw blankets, towels, house robe, dishcloths, hand towels and facecloths.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="day">
      <h3>Friday: Bedding</h3>
      <p>Wash sheets, pillowcases and throw blankets.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Everyday Reminders</h2>
    <div class="rule"></div>

    <ul class="reminders">
      <li>Go to bed with a clean kitchen, with no dishes left out or in the sink.</li>
      <li>Run the dishwasher.</li>
      <li>Keep laundry and the dryer moving as needed.</li>
      <li>Check and refill toilet paper roll holders.</li>
      <li>Switch out dishcloths.</li>
      <li>Refill tissue holders.</li>
      <li>Grind coffee.</li>
      <li>Refill water coolers in the gym.</li>
      <li>Fold throw blankets and fluff pillows daily.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .routine-page {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .routine-page h1,
  .routine-page h2 {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
  }

  .rule {
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--border);
    margin: 1rem auto 1.5rem;
    max-width: 180px;
  }

  .day {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .day h3 {
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .day p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .routine-page h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .reminders {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 1.5rem 3rem;
  }

  .reminders li {
    padding: 0.35rem 0;
  }
</style>
